WEBVTT

00:00:00.263 --> 00:00:05.251
An integration describes one backend call.

00:00:05.251 --> 00:00:13.134
Open the Developer Console and sign in with your console token.

00:00:13.134 --> 00:00:18.186
Integrations live in the Shared Collection. Open one.

00:00:18.186 --> 00:00:20.389
Basic: an id and a description.

00:00:20.389 --> 00:00:24.955
Backend: the gateway, the URL and the method.

00:00:24.955 --> 00:00:30.093
Parameters: what callers send, and where it comes from.

00:00:30.093 --> 00:00:34.023
Output: map backend fields onto your own JSON, with JSONPath.

00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:41.496
Add a field. Target is your name, source is the JSONPath.

00:00:41.496 --> 00:00:44.052
Optionally apply a transform, such as upper.

00:00:44.052 --> 00:00:52.010
Test it against the real backend before saving.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:56.992
Apply the mapping to see exactly what callers receive.

00:00:56.992 --> 00:00:59.429
We will close without saving. Saving writes a YAML file in your workspace.
